flowchart TB
  accTitle: Resolve Merge Conflicts in Lazygit
  accDescr: After a merge conflict, Lazygit lists the conflicted files. Press Enter to open a file and use Space for each conflict block to keep ours, theirs, or both. Once every block is resolved, stage the files with a and complete the merge commit with c.
  conflict["1 · A merge produces conflicts<br/>Files lists the conflicted files"]
  open["Enter · Open a conflicted file"]
  choose["2 · Resolve each conflict block<br/>Space to choose what to keep"]
  subgraph versions["Available versions"]
    direction LR
    ours["ours<br/>Current version"]
    theirs["theirs<br/>Incoming version"]
    both["both<br/>Keep both versions"]
    ours ~~~ theirs ~~~ both
  end
  resolved["Every conflict block is resolved"]
  stage["3 · a to stage resolved files"]
  commit["c · Complete the merge commit"]
  conflict --> open --> choose
  choose --> versions
  versions --> resolved
  resolved --> stage --> commit
